# GitHub Linguist: the course notebook (~400 KB, mostly cell outputs) would
# otherwise outweigh the Python source (~160 KB) and make the repo show up as
# "Jupyter Notebook". Exclude notebooks from the language stats; the project's
# real code is the Python package at the root.
*.ipynb linguist-documentation
notebook/** linguist-documentation

# Lockfiles are generated, not authored.
uv.lock linguist-generated
frontend/package-lock.json linguist-generated
